---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import { getCollection } from 'astro:content'; const posts=(await getCollection('posts')).filter(p=>p.data.category==='使用教程');
---
<BaseLayout title="教程"><header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">从安装到排错</span><h1>网络工具教程</h1><p>用清楚的步骤解决订阅导入、客户端配置和常见连接问题。</p></div></header><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="grid-3"><div class="card"><span class="tag">01</span><h3>选择适合的客户端</h3><p>优先考虑持续维护、来源可信、支持你的订阅格式与系统版本。</p></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">02</span><h3>建立正确的分流</h3><p>多数用户适合规则模式，避免无意义的全局代理与额外延迟。</p></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">03</span><h3>按顺序排查问题</h3><p>先查时间、订阅、系统代理，再查节点与服务公告。</p></div></div><div class="post-list" style="margin-top:28px">{posts.map(p=><a class="post-item" href={`/blog/${p.id}/`}><span class="tag">教程</span><div><strong>{p.data.title}</strong><div class="muted">{p.data.description}</div></div><time>{p.data.pubDate.toLocaleDateString('zh-CN')}</time></a>)}</div></div></section></BaseLayout>
